    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Necrofane</strong> is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler RPG set in a crumbling kingdom on the brink of ruin. Chosen by the crown in its darkest hour, you are a legendary knight tasked with stopping a necromancer who seeks to plunge the world into shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a cursed land overrun by the undead, monstrous beasts, and the necromancer\u2019s ruthless generals. Explore forgotten fortresses, ancient crypts, and decaying ruins to uncover legendary loot, unlock arcane powers, and become strong enough to challenge the necromancer himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as the kingdom's savior or become another corpse in the necromancer's army?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up online with 2\u20134 players and tackle dungeons, bosses, and quests together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse a dark, interconnected kingdom full of secrets, ruins, and monstrous threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Dungeon Crawling</strong> \u2013 Descend into handcrafted dungeons teeming with traps, treasures, and nightmarish foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School RPG Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Level up your character, improve your stats, and customize your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic &amp; Melee Combat</strong> \u2013 Wield devastating spells or strike down foes with steel in fast-paced, deadly encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Discover rare weapons, armor, and artifacts to upgrade and enhance your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against the necromancer\u2019s deadly generals, each guarding key regions of the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; NPCs</strong> \u2013 Meet strange allies and enemies alike in a world full of history, sorrow, and dark mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/bcbff6d93e8e03df3d09dd74f68c7ed4.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Necrofane</strong> is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler RPG set in a crumbling kingdom on the brink of ruin. Chosen by the crown in its darkest hour, you are a legendary knight tasked with stopping a necromancer who seeks to plunge the world into shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a cursed land overrun by the undead, monstrous beasts, and the necromancer\u2019s ruthless generals. Explore forgotten fortresses, ancient crypts, and decaying ruins to uncover legendary loot, unlock arcane powers, and become strong enough to challenge the necromancer himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as the kingdom's savior or become another corpse in the necromancer's army?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/60e14e884e6b707581e1ff4d6da46a00.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up online with 2\u20134 players and tackle dungeons, bosses, and quests together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse a dark, interconnected kingdom full of secrets, ruins, and monstrous threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Dungeon Crawling</strong> \u2013 Descend into handcrafted dungeons teeming with traps, treasures, and nightmarish foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School RPG Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Level up your character, improve your stats, and customize your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic &amp; Melee Combat</strong> \u2013 Wield devastating spells or strike down foes with steel in fast-paced, deadly encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Discover rare weapons, armor, and artifacts to upgrade and enhance your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against the necromancer\u2019s deadly generals, each guarding key regions of the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; NPCs</strong> \u2013 Meet strange allies and enemies alike in a world full of history, sorrow, and dark mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.poster.avif?t=1753999076\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.webm?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758090/extras/403e3ef31776a2bfc3f39e51ad6478f3.mp4?t=1753999076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A dark power is rising. Defeat the necromancer and his generals before they conquer the kingdom. In this old school dark fantasy RPG, explore cursed dungeons, battle monstrous foes, master forbidden magic, and gather powerful loot in a world teetering on the edge of ruin.",
